# AMBO — environment variables (EB-040, EB-041)
#
# AMBO_PRIVATE_DROP is the ONLY environment variable this project reads. It is a path,
# not a secret in itself — but its CONTENTS are secret. Nothing under this path is ever
# copied into the repository, written to an export, or written to a log (the logging
# filter in src/ambo/common/logging.py asserts the path string never appears in a
# message). `src/ambo/intake/standardize.py` is the only module permitted to read from
# it; every other module must go through data/real_anon/ or the DuckDB warehouse.
#
# The value below is a fictional example path — not the developer's real drop location.
AMBO_PRIVATE_DROP=C:\Users\example\Documents\ambo-private-drop
